    ('3d68442a-8cd7-4679-8845-189db9470f27'::uuid, 'card_description', 'In northern Greece, Toumba is the Greek name for the mounds Bronze Age settlements left behind. What the settlements left in the ground, and the word the mounds carry.', NULL, 'teaser-card-s032-rollback:3d68442a-8cd7-4679-8845-189db9470f27:card_description', 'rollback of teaser-card-s032: card_description None restored on Toumba', '89908b41eb1bff4129cabf2b1f4d66b9c4bf5b40e683c42bd741ecbc817743ee|fadbbc4117bb0748ff0664f0cfcc928fd0e441107b47e979e06c929705c937ed|fadbbc4117bb0748ff0664f0cfcc928fd0e441107b47e979e06c929705c937ed', '[{"source": "lane WB run wb-cardgap-2026-10-07: writer teaser-rewrite2-001", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-cardgap-2026-10-07/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "In northern Greece, Toumba is the Greek name for the mounds Bronze Age settlements left behind. What the settlements left in the ground, and the word the mounds carry."}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-cardgap-2026-10-07: checker teaser-check2-001 (check2), PASS", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-cardgap-2026-10-07/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "Toumba is in northern Greece [S1]; Toumba is the Greek name for these mounds [S1]; the mounds were created by settlements [S1]; the settlements were of the Bronze Age [S1]; the mounds are what the settlements left in the ground [S1]; the mounds carry the word Toumba [S1]"}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-cardgap-2026-10-07: verifier teaser-verify-015 (verify), VERIFIED", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-cardgap-2026-10-07/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "Toumba is the Greek local name for tell-like mounds of this kind [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tell_(archaeology)]; Toumba is a Greek word [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toumba]; The term denotes mounds [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toumba]; The mounds were created by Bronze Age settlements [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toumba]; The term also covers early Iron Age settlements [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toumba]; Such mounds occur in northern Greece [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toumba]; The mounds are the remains of settlements built up over centuries, not primarily grave mounds [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toumba]; They are the Greek equivalent of the Tell sites of the Near East [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toumba]"}]'::jsonb),
